  "answer_text": "While I would love to book this directly for you, I am an AI assistant and do not have access to your personal information (such as your full name, phone number, email, or credit card for reservation holds) to complete the booking. \n\nHowever, since Friday nights in downtown Chicago are highly popular and fill up quickly, I can guide you to the absolute best Italian spots in the downtown/River North area for **this Friday, June 12, 2026**, along with the direct links to lock in your table for two:\n\n### 1. **RPM Italian (River North)**\n* **Vibe:** Chic, sleek, and high-energy. If you are looking for a glamorous date night with great people-watching, this is the spot.\n* **Specialties:** Housemade pastas (like the famous Mama DePandi\u2019s Bucatini Pomodoro), wood-fired steaks, and an extensive wine list. \n* **How to Book:** Bookings are managed via Resy. You can check times and book a table directly on [Resy's RPM Italian page](https://resy.com/cities/chicago-il/venues/rpm-italian-chicago).\n\n### 2. **Osteria Via Stato (River North)**\n* **Vibe:** Warm, cozy, and romantic. With its candlelit dining room and rustic brick accents, it\u2019s perfect for a classic, intimate dinner.\n* **Specialties:** Roman-style thin-crust pizzas, artisanal salumi, and delicious seasonally driven Italian entrees. \n* **How to Book:** Bookings are managed via OpenTable. Secure a table directly on [OpenTable's Osteria Via Stato page](https://www.opentable.com/osteria-via-stato).\n\n### 3. **Quartino Ristorante (River North)**\n* **Vibe:** Lively, vintage, and bustling. It has a very fun, high-energy atmosphere that is great for a casual night out.\n* **Specialties:** Regional Italian small plates designed for sharing, hand-stretched pizzas, and wine served in carafes (*quartinos*). \n* **How to Book:** Bookings are managed via OpenTable. You can grab a spot on [OpenTable's Quartino Ristorante page](https://www.opentable.com/quartino).\n\n### 4. **Siena Tavern (River North)**\n* **Vibe:** Stylish, vibrant, and upscale-contemporary. Helmed by *Top Chef* alum Fabio Viviani.\n* **Specialties:** Their legendary housemade truffle cream gnocchi, Wagyu beef meatballs, and excellent craft cocktails.\n* **How to Book:** Bookings are managed via Resy. Secure your reservation on [Resy's Siena Tavern page](https://resy.com/cities/chicago-il/venues/siena-tavern).\n\n**Recommendation:** If you want a more romantic, quiet evening, go with **Osteria Via Stato**. If you want a lively, trendy scene with incredible pasta, try to snag a spot at **RPM Italian**!",
